  "vibe": "Undyed linen (#efe4d0) with madder red (#b5503c), indigo and olive — a natural dyer's palette. Cardo sets bookish serif headlines over Karla. The world is a working loom: eighteen warp threads run the full height and alternate lift on a shed cycle, while a shuttle travels the full width and flips at each selvedge to come back. It is the only pack here whose backdrop is a mechanism doing real work. Its mechanics are an assembling drag, a card stack, checkboxes and a rolling word. Best for textiles and fashion, makers and manufacturing, heritage crafts and supply-chain stories.",
